" end="00:49.823">cold </span><span begin="00:49.823" end="00:50.979">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.657" end="00:55.658"><span begin="00:51.657" end="00:52.026">Trying </span><span begin="00:52.026" end="00:52.381">figure </span><span begin="00:52.381" end="00:53.572">out </span><span begin="00:53.572" end="00:54.630">this </span><span begin="00:54.630" end="00:55.658">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.440" end="01:00.798"><span begin="00:56.440" end="00:56.654">Won't </span><span begin="00:56.654" end="00:57.456">you </span><span begin="00:57.456" end="00:57.828">take </span><span begin="00:57.828" end="00:58.059">me </span><span begin="00:58.059" end="00:58.261">by </span><span begin="00:58.261" end="00:58.442">the </span><span begin="00:58.442" end="00:58.764">hand </span><span begin="00:58.764" end="00:59.073">take </span><span begin="00:59.073" end="00:59.457">me </span><span begin="00:59.457" end="01:00.357">somewhere </span><span begin="01:00.357" end="01:00.798">new</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.380" end="01:07.253"><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:01.592">I </span><span begin="01:01.592" end="01:01.910">don't </span><span begin="01:01.910" end="01:02.275">know </span><span begin="01:02.275" end="01:02.637">who </span><span begin="01:02.637" end="01:03.042">you </span><span begin="01:03.042" end="01:03.934">are </span><span begin="01:03.934" end="01:04.303">but </span><span begin="01:04.303" end="01:05.925">I </span><span begin="01:05.925" end="01:06.250">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.250" end="01:06.565">with </span><span begin="01:06.565" end="01:07.253">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.584" end="01:12.404"><span begin="01:10.584" end="01:10.981">I'm </span><span begin="01:10.981" end="01:11.433">with </span><span begin="01:11.433" end="01:12.404">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.028" end="01:17.642"><span begin="01:16.028" end="01:16.195">I'm </span><span begin="01:16.195" end="01:16.496">look